 modules</article-title><source>New J. Phys.</source><year>2007</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>180</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gavin</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Functional organization of the yeast proteome by systematic analysis of protein complexes</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2002</year><volume>415</volume><fpage>141</fpage><lpage>147</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11805826</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gavin</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Proteome survey reveals modularity of the yeast cell machinery</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2006</year><volume>440</volume><fpage>631</fpage><lpage>636</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16429126</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Guldener</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>CYGD: the Comprehensive Yeast Genome Database</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res.</source><year>2005</year><volume>33</volume><issue>Suppl. 1</issue><fpage>D364</fpage><lpage>D368</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15608217</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Guldener</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Mpact: the mips protein interaction resource on yeast</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res.</source><year>2006</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>D436</fpage><lpage>D441</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16381906</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Han</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kamber</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><source>Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques</source><year>2006</year><edition>2</edition><publisher-name>Morgan Kaufmann Publishers</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hanisch</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Co-clustering of biological networks and gene expression data</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2002</year><volume>18</volume><issue>Suppl. 1</issue><fpage>S145</fpage><lpage>S154</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12169542</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Haraguchi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Okubo</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A method for pinpoint clustering of web pages with pseudo-clique search</article-title><source>Federation over the Web</source><year>2006</year><volume>3847</volume><publisher-loc>Springer</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Lecture Notes in Computer Science</publisher-name><fpage>59</fpage><lpage>78</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hermjakob</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>IntAct: an open source molecular interaction database</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res.</source><year>2004</year><volume>32</volume><issue>Suppl. 1</issue><fpage>D452</fpage><lpage>D455</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14681455</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Systematic discovery of functional modules and context-specific functional annotation of human genome</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2007</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>i222</fpage><lpage>i229</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17646300</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ideker</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Discovering regulatory and signalling circuits in molecular interaction networks</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2002</year><volume>18</volume><issue>Suppl. 1</issue><fpage>S233</fpage><lpage>S240</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12169552</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Janeway</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><source>Immunobiology: Immune System in Health and Disease</source><year>2005</year><publisher-name>Garland Publishing</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jansen</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>A Bayesian networks approach for predicting protein-protein interactions from genomic data</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2003</year><volume>302</volume><fpage>449</fpage><lpage>453</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14564010</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kipreos</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Pagano</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The f-box protein family</article-title><source>Genome Biol.</source><year>2000</year><volume>1</volume><comment>reviews3002.1&#x02013;reviews3002.7.</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Koepp</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Phosphorylation-dependent ubiquitination of cyclin E by the SCFFbw7 Ubiquitin ligase</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2001</year><volume>294</volume><fpage>173</fpage><lpage>177</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11533444</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Koyuturk</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Assessing significance of connectivity and conservation in protein interaction networks</article-title><source>J. Comput. Biol.</source><year>2007</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>747</fpage><lpage>764</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17691892</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Krogan</surname><given-names>NJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Global landscape of protein complexes in the yeast saccharomyces cerevisiae</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2006</year><volume>440</volume><fpage>637</fpage><lpage>643</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16554755</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lei</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Tye</surname><given-names>BK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Initiating DNA synthesis: from recruiting to activating the mcm complex</article-title><source>J. Cell Sci.</source><year>2001</year><volume>114</volume><fpage>1447</fpage><lpage>1454</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11282021</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ling</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>A role for MHR1, a gene requ